	measure 'Cohort Period Title' = ```
			
			VAR __MinCohort = CALCULATE( MIN(DIM_COHORTS[COHORT_MONTH]), ALLSELECTED(DIM_COHORTS))
			VAR __MaxCohort = MAX('Disconnected Calendar'[MONTH_START_DATE])
			VAR __Space = REPT(UNICHAR(160), 2)
			VAR __FormattedMinDate = FORMAT(__MinCohort, "MMM, yyyy")
			VAR __FormattedMaxDate = FORMAT(__MaxCohort, "MMM, yyyy")
			
			RETURN
			"Cohort Period: " & __Space & __Space & __FormattedMinDate & __Space & " - " & __Space & __FormattedMaxDate
			
			```
